  Piper voices — default neural voice models (VITS -> ONNX)
  https://github.com/rhasspy/piper
  Per-voice dataset licenses (vary by voice; check each voice's model card)

  Kokoro-82M — optional high-quality neural voice model
  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  Apache License 2.0

  Coqui TTS voices — optional downloadable voice models
  https://github.com/coqui-ai/TTS
